# Training Studio sidebar

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-training-studio-sidebar.md`. Inherits TR-00. Do not build the sidebar until the user feeds TR-04. Pipeline wiring is TR-02/TR-03.

Tabs train user assets on FAL serverless (no GPU infra). Genre presets are instant and free (prompt + grade + camera). Trained LoRAs lock style/identity (~$5, cost shown + confirmed). Character LoRA > reference images > seed. Voices attach to VaultCharacter. Training content is held only to serve that user — no platform harvest. Outcome ratings may feed OR-04/05.
